---
---

<section class="py-24 border-t border-ink-border bg-ink-950 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Photo Placeholder -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex items-center justify-center">
        <div class="relative w-80 h-96 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-ink-900 border border-ink-border flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 text-center shadow-xl group">
          <!-- Outer glowing accent -->
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand-primary/10 to-brand-accent/5 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
          
          <!-- Image Tag with obvious placeholder fallback -->
          <div class="relative z-10 w-full h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center border-2 border-dashed border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-4">
            <svg class="w-16 h-16 text-zinc-600 mb-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-xs text-zinc-500 block font-medium mb-1">Pravesh Rathore</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-zinc-600 block">Place headshot inside public/images/</span>
            
            <!-- Real optimized image -->
            <img 
              src="/images/pravesh-headshot.png" 
              alt="Pravesh Rathore" 
              class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-top rounded-2xl antialiased"
              style="transform: translateZ(0); backface-visibility: hidden; image-rendering: high-quality;"
              width="320"
              height="384"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Right Column: Copy -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-primary block mb-3 font-sans">
          The Developer
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-[clamp(1.75rem,2vw+1rem,2.75rem)] font-extrabold text-white mb-8 tracking-tight font-display">
          Built by someone who builds for banks
        </h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-6 text-zinc-300 text-base leading-relaxed font-sans mb-10">
          <p>
            I'm <strong class="text-white">Pravesh Rathore</strong> — a full-stack engineer based in Noida. For the last two years, I've built and maintained mission-critical software for banking and financial institutions: systems that process cheque clearances (NPCI), validate core banking transactions, and move money safely between secure databases that cannot afford to go down.
          </p>
          <p>
            That might sound unrelated to a local clinic, salon, or restaurant website — but it's not. The same engineering discipline that goes into building a secure system that can't fail is the discipline I bring to a one-page site that has to load instantly, look pixel-perfect on a client's phone in poor network areas, and never show a broken WhatsApp button at the moment a customer is trying to book.
          </p>
          <p>
            I have also designed and built scalable, real-time web platforms from scratch — including vehicle service marketplaces featuring real-time bidding via WebSockets, multi-role access control for multiple distinct user types, and sub-100ms response times — entirely on my own, from architecture to server deployment.
          </p>
          <p>
            I'm not a template reseller. I'm a professional engineer who believes local businesses deserve the same level of care, speed, and reliability that I'd build into a financial application — just delivered fast, and priced fairly for your business.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Verifiable Stats Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-8 border-t border-ink-border">
          <div>
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-white block mb-1">2+ Years</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-zinc-500 block leading-snug">in production fintech development</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-white block mb-1">3+</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-zinc-500 block leading-snug">banking institutions supported</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-white block mb-1">1 Platform</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-zinc-500 block leading-snug">architected solo end-to-end</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
